window.LEARN_CONTENT=window.LEARN_CONTENT||{};window.LEARN_CONTENT["a-39bd463cbdcbb8f2"]={"zh":"<p><a id=\"run-event-playbooks\"></a></p> <h1 id=\"_1\">运行活动执行手册</h1> <p>为活动项目管理创建可重复使用的工作流程。</p> <p>使用 ChatGPT、Slack、Google Drive 和 Calendar 汇总活动筹备信息，起草面向参与者的文案，并准备一份含负责人、审批项和待解决问题的内部检查清单。</p> <p><a id=\"best-for\"></a></p> <h2 id=\"_2\">适合哪些情况</h2> <ul> <li>负责活动的社区、开发者关系、营销和运营团队。</li> <li>需要将公开文案与内部运营信息分开的活动页面、交接材料和启动检查清单。</li> <li>需要有来源依据的模板、负责人、审批项和待解决问题的周期性活动项目。</li> </ul> <p><a id=\"skills-plugins\"></a></p> <h2 id=\"_3\">技能与插件</h2> <table> <thead> <tr> <th>技能或插件</th> <th>用途</th> </tr> </thead> <tbody> <tr> <td><a href=\"https://github.com/openai/plugins/tree/main/plugins/slack\" target=\"_blank\" rel=\"noopener noreferrer\">slack（需联网）</a></td> <td>读取界定当前活动范围的筹备频道、讨论串、画布和决策记录。</td> </tr> <tr> <td><a href=\"https://github.com/openai/plugins/tree/main/plugins/google-drive\" target=\"_blank\" rel=\"noopener noreferrer\">google-drive（需联网）</a></td> <td>收集已批准的模板、活动文档、演示文稿、回顾记录和启动素材。</td> </tr> <tr> <td><a href=\"https://github.com/openai/plugins/tree/main/plugins/google-calendar\" target=\"_blank\" rel=\"noopener noreferrer\">google-calendar（需联网）</a></td> <td>在编制执行手册时核对活动时间、截止日期和会议背景。</td> </tr> <tr> <td><code>sheets</code></td> <td>以结构化格式跟踪任务、负责人和截止日期。</td> </tr> </tbody> </table> <p><a id=\"starter-prompt\"></a></p> <h2 id=\"_4\">起步提示词</h2> <p>编制活动执行手册</p> <p>建议推理级别：<code>medium</code></p> <pre><code class=\"language-text\">请为 [event] 编制一份有来源依据的执行手册。\n\n使用以下来源：\n- 筹备频道或讨论串：[links or names]\n- 已批准的文档、演示文稿、表格或模板：[links or names]\n- 日历活动或截止日期：[links or dates]\n\n请将输出拆分为以下部分：\n- 面向参与者的文案\n- 内部运营检查清单\n- 负责人分工表\n- 支持计划或资源\n- 尚待批准的事项\n- 待解决问题\n- 来源附录\n\n不要发布任何内容，也不要假设缺失的细节。将未知信息列入待解决问题，并确保内部运营信息不出现在公开文案中。\n</code></pre> <p><a id=\"related-links\"></a></p> <h2 id=\"_5\">关联文档</h2> <ul> <li><a href=\"#/article/a-dea5d8982f047a3a\">插件</a></li> <li><a href=\"#/article/a-b5406e60cbfa0b68\">定时任务</a></li> <li><a href=\"#/article/a-345f9e63361a6444\">在 Slack 中使用 ChatGPT</a></li> </ul> <blockquote> <p>完整文档索引请参阅 <a href=\"https://learn.chatgpt.com/llms.txt\" target=\"_blank\" rel=\"noopener noreferrer\">llms.txt（需联网）</a>。在文档页面 URL 末尾添加 <code>.md</code>，即可获取该页面的 Markdown 版本。</p> </blockquote> <p><a id=\"introduction\"></a></p> <h2 id=\"_6\">简介</h2> <p>管理活动项目时，相关信息往往分散在多个来源中，例如 <a href=\"https://developers.openai.com/community/meetups\" target=\"_blank\" rel=\"noopener noreferrer\">ChatGPT 社区聚会（需联网）</a>的公开活动页面、项目支持计划、Slack 消息、表格或文档等。你可以让 ChatGPT 汇总已批准的筹备资料，并将面向参与者的文案与内部运营细节分开，整理成一份执行手册。</p> <p><a id=\"create-your-first-playbook\"></a></p> <h2 id=\"_7\">创建第一份执行手册</h2> <p>使用起始提示词，请 ChatGPT 为你生成一份活动执行手册。手册应当：</p> <ul> <li>列出筹备信息来源（例如链接、内部工具等）。</li> <li>列出所需信息。</li> <li>说明面向参与者的文案规则（不要包含内部后勤安排）。</li> </ul> <p>你应当得到一份检查清单，供每次筹备新活动时核对。</p> <p><a id=\"schedule-the-playbook-from-the-task\"></a></p> <p><a id=\"schedule-a-playbook-task-inside-the-chat\"></a></p> <h2 id=\"_8\">在聊天中安排执行手册任务</h2> <p>首次运行活动执行手册的提示词并确认效果后，可以保持该聊天打开，并请 ChatGPT <a href=\"https://developers.openai.com/codex/automations#schedule-a-task-inside-a-chat\" target=\"_blank\" rel=\"noopener noreferrer\">在该聊天中安排执行手册任务</a>（官网章节，需联网） <a href=\"https://developers.openai.com/codex/automations/\" target=\"_blank\" rel=\"noopener noreferrer\">本地页面（本地尚未收录）</a>。</p> <p><strong>提示词：</strong></p> <pre><code class=\"language-text\">Schedule a task from this chat to review the new event requests.\n\nCheck:\n\n- attendee-facing copy has no private logistics, budget notes, or internal-only partner context\n- asks are in line with the event program\n\nAnd give me a draft for follow up questions/checks I could send.\n</code></pre><div class=\"prompt-translation\"><div class=\"prompt-reference-heading\"><strong>提示词中文参考</strong><button class=\"copy-code copy-prompt-translation\" type=\"button\" aria-label=\"复制中文参考\">复制中文</button></div><div class=\"prompt-reference-text\">从这个聊天中安排一项任务，审阅新的活动请求。\n\n检查：\n\n- 面向参加者的文案中没有私密的后勤安排、预算备注或仅供内部使用的合作方上下文\n- 各项请求与活动方案一致\n\n并给我一份草稿，列出我可以发送的后续问题或核查事项。</div></div>","en":"<h1 id=\"run-event-playbooks\">Run event playbooks</h1> <p>Create repeatable workflows for event program management.</p> <p>Use ChatGPT with Slack, Google Drive, and Calendar to gather planning context, draft attendee-facing copy, and prepare a private checklist with owners, approvals, and open questions.</p> <h2 id=\"best-for\">Best for</h2> <ul> <li>Community, developer relations, marketing, and operations teams running events.</li> <li>Event pages, handoffs, and launch checklists where public copy and private operations need to stay separate.</li> <li>Recurring event programs that need source-backed templates, owners, approvals, and open questions.</li> </ul> <h2 id=\"skills-plugins\">Skills &amp; Plugins</h2> <table> <thead> <tr> <th>Skill or plugin</th> <th>Why use it</th> </tr> </thead> <tbody> <tr> <td><a href=\"https://github.com/openai/plugins/tree/main/plugins/slack\" target=\"_blank\" rel=\"noopener noreferrer\">slack (online)</a></td> <td>Read planning channels, threads, canvases, and decisions that define the current event scope.</td> </tr> <tr> <td><a href=\"https://github.com/openai/plugins/tree/main/plugins/google-drive\" target=\"_blank\" rel=\"noopener noreferrer\">google-drive (online)</a></td> <td>Gather approved templates, event docs, decks, recap notes, and launch assets.</td> </tr> <tr> <td><a href=\"https://github.com/openai/plugins/tree/main/plugins/google-calendar\" target=\"_blank\" rel=\"noopener noreferrer\">google-calendar (online)</a></td> <td>Check event timing, deadlines, and meeting context while building the playbook.</td> </tr> <tr> <td><code>sheets</code></td> <td>Track tasks, owners, and deadlines in a structured format.</td> </tr> </tbody> </table> <h2 id=\"starter-prompt\">Starter prompt</h2> <p>Build the Event Playbook</p> <p>Suggested reasoning effort：<code>medium</code></p> <pre><code class=\"language-text\">Create a source-backed playbook for [event].\n\nSources to use:\n- planning channels or threads: [links or names]\n- approved docs, decks, sheets, or templates: [links or names]\n- calendar events or deadlines: [links or dates]\n\nSplit the output into:\n- attendee-facing copy\n- private operating checklist\n- owner map\n- support plan or resources\n- approvals still needed\n- open questions\n- source appendix\n\nDo not publish anything or assume missing details. Put unknowns in open questions and keep private operations out of the public copy.\n</code></pre> <h2 id=\"related-links\">Related links</h2> <ul> <li><a href=\"#/article/a-dea5d8982f047a3a\">Plugins</a></li> <li><a href=\"#/article/a-b5406e60cbfa0b68\">Scheduled tasks</a></li> <li><a href=\"#/article/a-345f9e63361a6444\">Use ChatGPT in Slack</a></li> </ul> <blockquote> <p>For the complete documentation index, see <a href=\"https://learn.chatgpt.com/llms.txt\" target=\"_blank\" rel=\"noopener noreferrer\">llms.txt (online)</a>. Markdown versions of documentation pages are available by appending <code>.md</code> to the page URL.</p> </blockquote> <h2 id=\"introduction\">Introduction</h2> <p>When you have event programs to manage, for example our <a href=\"https://developers.openai.com/community/meetups\" target=\"_blank\" rel=\"noopener noreferrer\">ChatGPT community meetups (online)</a>, you often have context scattered across multiple sources:</p> <ul> <li>The public event page</li> <li>The program support plan</li> <li>Slack messages</li> <li>Sheets or documents</li> <li>etc.</li> </ul> <p>You can use ChatGPT to gather the approved planning sources and turn them into a playbook that separates attendee-facing copy from private operating details.</p> <h2 id=\"create-your-first-playbook\">Create your first playbook</h2> <p>Use the starter prompt to ask ChatGPT to generate an event playbook for you. It should:</p> <ul> <li>Name planning sources (these could be links, internal tools, etc.)</li> <li>List required information</li> <li>Define rules for attendee-facing copy (keeping internal logistics out of it)</li> </ul> <p>You should get a list of things to check and run every time a new event is planned.</p> <p><a id=\"schedule-the-playbook-from-the-task\"></a></p> <h2 id=\"schedule-a-playbook-task-inside-the-chat\">Schedule a playbook task inside the chat</h2> <p>After the first run of your new playbook works, keep the same chat open and ask ChatGPT to <a href=\"https://developers.openai.com/codex/automations#schedule-a-task-inside-a-chat\" target=\"_blank\" rel=\"noopener noreferrer\">schedule a task for the playbook from that chat</a> (official section, online) <a href=\"https://developers.openai.com/codex/automations/\" target=\"_blank\" rel=\"noopener noreferrer\">Local page (not in this local snapshot)</a>.</p> <p><strong>Prompt:</strong></p> <pre><code class=\"language-text\">Schedule a task from this chat to review the new event requests.\n\nCheck:\n\n- attendee-facing copy has no private logistics, budget notes, or internal-only partner context\n- asks are in line with the event program\n\nAnd give me a draft for follow up questions/checks I could send.\n</code></pre>"};
